/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Welcome aboard! We're thrilled to have you join our team and contribute to our mission of Garden City Church. As an employee of our church, it's important for you to know that we operate as a non-profit organization, which means we adhere to certain legal standards and obligations. As such, you have rights protected under state and federal labor laws, including but not limited to minimum wage requirements, anti-discrimination laws, and workplace safety regulations. We are committed to providing a safe and respectful work environment where you can thrive in your role. If you have any questions or concerns about your rights or responsibilities as an employee, please don't hesitate to reach out to our HR department or leadership team. Once again, welcome aboard, and we look forward to working together to make a positive impact in our community!)
/E (Welcome aboard! We're thrilled to have you join our team and contribute to our mission of Garden City Church. As an employee of our church, it's important for you to know that we operate as a non-profit organization, which means we adhere to certain legal standards and obligations. As such, you have rights protected under state and federal labor laws, including but not limited to minimum wage requirements, anti-discrimination laws, and workplace safety regulations. We are committed to providing a safe and respectful work environment where you can thrive in your role. If you have any questions or concerns about your rights or responsibilities as an employee, please don't hesitate to reach out to our HR department or leadership team. Once again, welcome aboard, and we look forward to working together to make a positive impact in our community!)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
