/T (Serving within a church is more than just employment; it's an opportunity to engage in kingdom-work. We believe that our work yields eternal results, and it's a joy and privilege to know that through our labor, we are essentially working for the Lord. While this principle applies to all aspects of life, we find particular joy in directly contributing to the growth and expansion of the Church of Jesus Christ.)
/E (Serving within a church is more than just employment; it's an opportunity to engage in kingdom-work. We believe that our work yields eternal results, and it's a joy and privilege to know that through our labor, we are essentially working for the Lord. While this principle applies to all aspects of life, we find particular joy in directly contributing to the growth and expansion of the Church of Jesus Christ.)
