<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (At Garden City Church, our employees play a pivotal role in advancing the mission and vision of the church. Each team member is entrusted with the responsibility to contribute their unique skills and faithfully carry out their part, ensuring the church fulfills its purpose. Together, through collaboration, open communication, and shared commitment, we support one another in achieving the mission God has called us to accomplish.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Employees are expected to offer visionary leadership within their assigned ministries, developing programs that encourage discipleship, or leading small group studies focused on biblical literacy. Our aim is to foster salvation, a deeper commitment to prayer and to the Scriptures, and the baptism of the Holy Spirit within our congregation. We actively mobilize efforts for outreach, evangelism, and mission trips. We seek creative, dynamic individuals eager to contribute their distinct gifts to our church family. Mutual support and a willingness to lend a hand across departments are highly valued. Here, the mindset of "that's not my job" is actively rejected in favor of a culture where we champion each other's success.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
