174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To ensure clear communication and minimize confusion, Garden City Church maintains an open-door policy, giving all employees direct access to their supervisors and ultimately the Lead Pastor. The Lead Pastor provides leadership for all staff, offering consultation, check-ins, development, encouragement, and counsel as needed. While collaboration across ministries is highly encouraged, it is important to clarify reporting relationships to avoid unnecessary confusion. All staff report directly to the Lead Pastor regarding their roles, responsibilities, and initiatives. Certain ministries, such as Children's and Youth, may require more frequent collaboration due to shared responsibilities or overlapping demographics. In such cases, open communication and teamwork are not only encouraged but expected.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
