/S /P
/E (We believe that God created all men and women in His image, but sin leads humanity to rebel against God and His Word, including in the area of human sexuality. At Garden City Church, we welcome all who struggle with sin, including sexual sin, and guide them toward repentance and faith in Jesus Christ as Lord and Savior. )
