/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Due to the significant nature of major holidays such as Christmas and Easter, vacations are not permitted during these times. All staff are required to be present and actively serve during these critical periods. Exceptions may be made in extraordinary circumstances, but these must be approved by church leadership well in advance and are subject to the needs of the church.)
