/E (In rare cases, the church may issue an alternative schedule that affects vacation availability. We will communicate any such changes as early as possible to allow you to plan accordingly. Your flexibility and understanding in these situations are greatly appreciated.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
