380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We value and appreciate the dedication and hard work you bring to our church community. By being present and engaged in all services and activities, especially during major holidays, you help to foster a welcoming and vibrant environment for all members and visitors. We are committed to supporting you in your ministry and ensuring you have the time you need for personal rest and rejuvenation.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If you have any questions or need further clarification regarding this policy, please feel free to reach out to church leadership. We are here to support you and ensure that your time with us is fulfilling and balanced.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
