/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (For credentialed or ordained employees whose giving is directed towards a district, we encourage them to maintain their commitment as required. We also encourage all employees to consider missional giving and to participate in other aspects of giving as they feel led by the Lord. We believe in sowing into our community and others, but first bringing it into the storehouse.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Additionally, we encourage all employees to fast regularly and to participate in our annual fast or other church-wide initiatives. Fasting can take various forms, including specialized meal plans or modifications that suit individual needs. The most important aspect is a willing heart. While we do not mandate participation, we seek employees who understand the value of commitment and participation.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [19]
>>
